        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLOCK IN. BUILD YOUR CONFIDENCE. WIN THE DATE.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Johni, the newest hire at an office where the deadlines are real, the coworkers are complicated, and your next crush may be one conversation away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crushing on the Clock</strong> is a comedy dating/life sim that turns romance into a strategy game. Use each day to work, earn money, improve your mood, energy, and looks, shop for gifts and outfits, and learn what makes each person tick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you  ask someone out, the date becomes a turn-based <strong>Rizz-Turn battle</strong>. Choose your moves carefully, read the person across from you, and try not to kill the mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/244b6eb998772967f406fd77cad32540.avif?t=1787528872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras_big/244b6eb998772967f406fd77cad32540.avif?t=1787528872 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR 9-TO-5 IS ONLY THE BEGINNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk with your coworkers, build affection, unlock phone numbers, exchange texts and calls, give gifts, and pursue five distinct office romance routes. (2 more romances in VayKay)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wider cast has personalities, problems, friendships, and comedic storylines of their own. Every workday can open a new opportunity—or create a new disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/1b4448e538da3ce85808cab6f3f77c9b.avif?t=1787528872\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DATES ARE TURN-BASED BATTLES OF CHARM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dating is more than selecting the nicest dialogue option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a Rizz-Turn date, choose actions such as <strong>Talk, Flirt, Brag, Joke</strong> and—if you have your looks up enough—<strong>Touch</strong>. Spend your Rizz wisely and choose moves that fit your date’s personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The work you do during the week determines the options you have when it matters most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/68b9fd867d2fdf1e3491061a700d3366.avif?t=1787528872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras_big/68b9fd867d2fdf1e3491061a700d3366.webp?t=1787528872 width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A LIFE WORTH DATING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your job, money, mood, energy, and appearance while exploring life outside the office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work out, shop, buy gifts, discover new locations, play minigames, respond to unexpected calls and texts, unlock animated memories in your Photo Album, and fill your Achievement Room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/8e17bcddbcfbc64667d6f0eec558f6cf.avif?t=1787528872\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GET OFF THE CLOCK IN VAYKAY CITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When vacation week arrives, leave the office behind and explore VayKay City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go fishing, enter a bike race, play fairground games, shop for souvenirs, and pursue two additional vacation romance arcs with <strong>Cheri and Riley</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens in VayKay City may follow you home, although Greg won't tell anyone how many times you passed out drunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/3be733db8ccb04eb2a117114af6640cc.avif?t=1787528872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras_big/3be733db8ccb04eb2a117114af6640cc.avif?t=1787528872 width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five main office romance routes and two VayKay romance arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Rizz-Turn dating encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, money, time, mood, energy, and appearance management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone calls, texts, gifts, outfits, shops, and random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, biking, bowling, darts, fairground games, and other activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated scenes and an unlockable Photo Album</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial voice acting and an original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and replayable choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
