=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras/3be733db8ccb04eb2a117114af6640cc.avif?t=1787528872\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088750/extras_big/3be733db8ccb04eb2a117114af6640cc.avif?t=1787528872 width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five main office romance routes and two VayKay romance arcs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based Rizz-Turn dating encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work, money, time, mood, energy, and appearance management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone calls, texts, gifts, outfits, shops, and random events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing, biking, bowling, darts, fairground games, and other activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated scenes and an unlockable Photo Album</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial voice acting and an original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and replayable choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >38 Steam achievements</p></li></ul>",
